        {
            "title": "Major technical update - new version!",
            "date": "2016-10-28 10:51:30",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/212060165295476446",
            "notes": "Good news, we have considered your feedback and comments and improved various features of the game.\r\n[list]\r\n    [*]1st: improved graphics - with high quality lighting and shadows, \r\n    [*]2nd: better gameplay balancing for the singleplayer campaign and missions, \r\n    [*]3rd: more realism by using advanced blood effects and textures for injured hostiles and friendly units. \r\n[/list]\r\n\r\nCheck out the new version and get ready for the fight!"
        },
