        {
            "title": "Update for Elite vs. Freedom!",
            "date": "2016-06-16 22:43:09",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/250328813698364538",
            "notes": "We improved the third-person camera movement and behavior. Additionally, we added the ability to sprint (including stamina). We also changed the default controls: press \"Shift\" to sprint and press \"Space\" to jump. On the controller \"Left Bumper\" is now Sprint and \"B Button\" is Autocannon. The default controls, including mouse sensitivity can be customized by the users anytime in the \"Settings\" menu."
        },
